# SERIAL alone, the window closed after one hit (Windows' End Task, the
# web page's tab closed: WM_CLOSE, then WM_DESTROY). The shot is the first
# of serial-alone-win.input (a killer, +200); 4 lives are left.
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame serial --headless --ms 21000 --input tools/play/serial-close.input
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame serial --headless --ms 21000 --fix all,-serial_intro_screen,-serial_end_screen --input tools/play/serial-close.input
#
# - Original: WM_DESTROY reports as at the clock's end, a win of
#   MAKELONG(4, 500) (BUGS.md K1, K2, K6);
# - `--fix all`: the close forfeits, a loss with the 200 points.
# shot 1: straight, 3sbabt (figure 2, kind 2)
16200 key right
